Key details about the casting and plot of the "Aquaman" sequel.

- Yani Zhao will play Stingray, a new character created specifically for the film;  
- Indya Moore will voice Karshon the shark — originally a villain from the Green Lantern comics;  
- Vincent Regan takes on the role of Atlan, the ancient ruler of Atlantis;  
- Randall Park returns as Dr. Stephen Shin, the marine biologist obsessed with uncovering Atlantis’ location in the comics.

We’re waiting for the DC Fandome panel on October 16!

